+### Controlled stack copies
+
+`Effects.CopyControlledStackObjects(kinds, player = Player.You)` snapshots the selected player's
+spells and/or activated/triggered abilities currently on the shared stack. `StackObjectKind` selects
+which kinds are included; no mana abilities enter the stack. The resolving object is excluded while
+other pending instances of its ability remain eligible. A batch is ordered by its controller, then
+copies use the ordinary copy/retarget continuations, preserving modes, X and cost-linked values.
